        The data presented throughout this guide points to a clear conclusion for most startup and mid-sized fashion brands: Bangladesh offers superior value for basic to mid-range knitwear manufacturing. This isn't a sales pitch - it's the logical outcome of comparing MOQ requirements, landed costs, tariff exposure, and certification coverage across the two countries. Let's examine what brands actually get when they choose Bangladesh over China.
