        Intellectual property protection remains a concern for some brands considering Bangladesh. This is valid - IP enforcement in Bangladesh has historically been weaker than in China. However, SDF addresses this through comprehensive NDAs, segregated production lines, and legal frameworks for <a href="/confidentiality" class="link">confidentiality agreement for your designs</a>. The key is contractual protection, not geographic assumptions. Brands that implement proper IP safeguards can manufacture safely in Bangladesh.
